  "description": "The target file's options.login_timeout (V7): the per-target override of config.yaml's worker.login_timeout, the one clock for a device login. Integer seconds, 10 to 1800, as the schema enforces. Valid: 120; 10; 1800; absent, so the knob applies. Invalid: 9; 1801; a Go duration string \"120s\"; a non-integer.",
  "corpus": [
    "Storage §2.5",
    "session model §11",
    "device-login bounds"
  ],
  "case": {
